  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Australia Secondary School Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the PNG Australia Secondary School Program is to support future leaders, and the stability and prosperity of PNG, by improving education at PNG&#x2019;s high-performing secondary schools. The Goal is that students at participating upper secondary schools have improved learning outcomes and leadership capabilities. The program will work towards this goal by improving teaching and learning; strengthening school safety, resilience and inclusivity; and ensuring supportive Australia-PNG relations in the secondary education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
